insert into public.character_profiles(slug,display_name,tagline,heading,bio,mood,location,interests,theme,music_title) values
('page','Page','the bookbinder’s little corner of the web','Somewhere beneath the roots','Page binds books, keeps records, and makes sure someone knows the road out. He came through the Feylight Festival looking for a bookshop and reached Latesa with a party to look after. He has paid for the rooms. He would like everyone to use them.','One more chapter.','The Hollow Heart, Rockside','Hand-sewn bindings
A room with another exit
Books borrowed on unusual terms
Knowing where everyone is','moon','Under the Roots'),
('ceridwen','Ceridwen','songs from the other side of the fire','Leave a candle in the window','Ceridwen paid her way into the Feylight Festival with a story. In the cistern house, she played the campfire song Legion knew from the road. When the courtyard turned against the party, she reached for the power at her wrist.','Let me find the words.','Somewhere near the fire','Stories told aloud
A familiar campfire song
The people at this table
A little time to think','candle','The Last Candle'),
('coy','Coy','field notes, damp boots, occasional wildlife','Something green grows here','Coy follows magic into gardens, tunnels, and places with very bad water. At the cistern house, he recognized a transmutation resonance like Legion’s own. When Legion risked losing themselves in the other hive, Coy reminded them who they were.','Hold still. Let me look.','Following the water','Living things
A useful spell
Clean water
An answer worth getting muddy for','water','Water Through Stone'),
('legion','Legion','many small visitors in a very large coat','We made a place for ourselves','Legion carries clay tablets and little runes beneath their robes. At the cistern, they let that shape fall away to meet another swarm. They offered it memories of Simon, and helped a frightened hive begin to find a self of its own.','We are here.','Where the others are','Honey
Clay tablets
The campfire song
A name chosen freely','hive','A Thousand Small Wings'),
('simon','Simon','a page kept open by his companions','Keep a place at the table','Simon came down the road to the Feylight Festival with the Five. Inside the gates, he went shopping, rang a booth’s bell hard enough to empty his head, and won a silver ticket. His companions carried memories of him into the cistern house.','A memory from the road.','In the Chronicle','The festival’s bright stalls
A silver prize ticket
Friends on the road
Stories worth keeping','rose','A Place at the Table'),
('selim','Selim Varek','the watchman’s noticeboard','There is work still to do','Selim arrived in white and gold, an old ally of Stross with orders to protect the party. Asked to consider a hive as a citizen, he recognized the theft of its brood as kidnapping. In the courtyard, he turned a spear away from Page when it mattered.','Standing watch.','Somewhere beyond the next patrol','A duty carried through
A question taken seriously
Keeping someone on their feet
A clear road home','watch','The Quiet Watch'),
('the-gunslinger','The Gunslinger','this page has very little identifying information','You saw nothing','A small figure in a red-and-purple coat appeared in the Whites with two pistols, a wide-brimmed hat, and a clicking construct. The stranger fired on the militia in the courtyard. The party still had questions about whose side they were on.','Keeping the mask on.','Ask someone else.','A wide-brimmed hat
A coat that shifts in the mist
Keeping a little distance
Questions left unanswered','powder','Smoke in the Alley');
